Abstract: Overview of the DASH-IF conformance and reference tools: the DASH-IF Conformance Validator, the dash.js reference player, the livesim2 live source simulator, and the DASH-IF test assets, together with the contextual interpretation of conformance keywords. Working draft authored in the IOPv5 workspace.

